  unitName: Sky Emperor Grafl
  unitId: 40063
  unitNumber: 315
  description: An air pirate using an otherworldly pistol, widely known throughout
    the ruined Atharva Republic. Grafl made his way through the sky on his ship,
    fighting the gods as he went along. Aiding his good friend Sky King Falma in
    vanquishing the gods, his skills as a marksman quickly surpassed that of a mere
    support gunner, and he soon found himself taking down gods himself. In appreciation
    of Grafl's support despite this, Falma affectionately called him the Sky Emperor.
  summonDesc: This gun belongs to me and<br>the lost souls of my dear friends.<br>You
    must've known this already.
  fusionDesc: This gun isn't just loaded<br>with bullets, you know?<br>I've put my
    soul into it!
  evoDesc: Evolving isn't so bad.<br>I wonder if I may finally be<br>able to stand
    beside you now?
